{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/eG8kowjizaavkrB1cv_OSw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:53.128318+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/eG8kowjizaavkrB1cv_OSw","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/M9EQ9m70DkHg7pQBia0y7e2KGjjgPOLkvS757j2s6NRSM0buPicRbsiao5pvBKvwlJYN4nnkbhzCXFmkia5KN7I5Hg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/M9EQ9m70DkHg7pQBia0y7e2KGjjgPOLkvv4g0ebIlRIEdbyozdiauDYIVqibiaxnXwHcIb2bKX3v1wIvYmgq9IYegg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/M9EQ9m70DkHg7pQBia0y7e2KGjjgPOLkvZ6jf8xKz8mQfw5yqibvupDBITx3jbJlNBv8OLOMZPLNRfewOgjW0ytA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/M9EQ9m70DkHg7pQBia0y7e2KGjjgPOLkvIbU2WNcpH7FriaYdMesAca4dibMMNZj6KIWb8A26bOf3XK4EgaHBkDow/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/M9EQ9m70DkHg7pQBia0y7e2KGjjgPOLkvDyNIWZJrb1aK6Ek6yrwdNbSzmV8KM4hXko0YaPUYOfgzJrbGlOOS3g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/M9EQ9m70DkHg7pQBia0y7e2KGjjgPOLkvZK7FPG7WnWPYTv4valaJneLkBiaB8uC8Wn4rSOYVXpP7h96LHp5IXaQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/M9EQ9m70DkHg7pQBia0y7e2KGjjgPOLkvx4xZpGPSjzkwBncksImZaRoZ1iaOicUHkVT14QI60KEYFMbVyQsIugMg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>西湖大学感知与计算成像实验室长期致力于人工智能和光学交叉的前沿方向——计算成像相关的研究。集计算机前沿和硬件实现于一体，集数据感知采集和具象表征于整机，丰富的计算资源与前沿硬件为你的梦想赋予飞翔的翅膀。欢迎有志于人工智能如多模态大模型、光学如新型传感器开发、成像如高维数据采集的优秀学子一起加入，携手共创未来！</span></p><p><span>本实验室专注并在国际上引领单曝光压缩成像(Snapshot Compressive Imaging)系统的研发，主要包括：</span></p><p><span>1）基于深度学习的单曝光压缩成像重建、视频增强、弱光增强、图像复原等一系列逆问题的研究；</span></p><p><span>2）视频单曝光压缩成像系统、光谱单曝光压缩成像系统、光学相干层析成像系统、单曝光数字全息成像系统、单曝光显微成像系统等多种光学系统的搭建。此外，本实验室拥有近100平方米超净间，计算资源丰富，目前已购置显卡近100张，包括NVIDIA A40、L40S、RTX 4090、RTX 3090、RTX 3080、A8000等。</span></p><p><span>自2021年10月成立以来，本实验室在计算机顶刊T-PAMI、IJCV、TIP，计算机顶会CVPR、ICCV、ECCV，光学顶刊Optica、PhotoniX，与合作单位在综合性期刊Nature Computational Science、Nature Communications等发表100余篇学术论文。多篇论文获得ECCV 2024最佳论文提名（top 15）、ECCV 2024口头报告等优秀成绩。本实验室注重研究生培养，自成立以来多名博士研究生获得国家奖学金和西湖大学苏武奖学金等荣誉称号。</span><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/M9EQ9m70DkHg7pQBia0y7e2KGjjgPOLkvOePkQ2alZrHuqrSSk1csdr0X6L5PE5pA90Ap8QfdVOrVHWdbW66SXQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/M9EQ9m70DkHg7pQBia0y7e2KGjjgPOLkvx4xZpGPSjzkwBncksImZaRoZ1iaOicUHkVT14QI60KEYFMbVyQsIugMg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>合作导师：　　</span><span><br/></span><span>      袁鑫，西湖大学工学院人工智能系终身副教授，西湖大学工学院感知与计算成像实验室负责人，博士生导师。2025年因在单曝光压缩计算成像领域的开创性贡献入选美国光学学会会士（Optica Fellow）。2021年入选国家海外高层次青年人才、浙江省高层次人才，2022年浙江省杰青。香港理工大学博士（2009-2012）、美国杜克大学博士后（2012-2015）、美国贝尔实验室视频分析与编码首席研究员（2015-2021）。入选斯坦福全球前2%顶尖科学家“终身科学影响力排行榜”。截至目前，共发表文章300余篇，谷歌学术引用超过 12000余次，H指数58；申请专利30多项（已授权15项),其中多项专利已进行产业孵化；担任包括<span>IEEE Transactions on Image Processing, Optics and Laser Technology, Pattern </span></span><span><span>Recognition, Chinese Optics Letters,  Advanced Imaging</span></span><span>在内的多家国际期刊编委，是国际上单曝光压缩成像技术的主要推动者。自 2021 年 10 月加入西湖大学以来，袁鑫老师组建35人规模团队，目前指导博士生11人，形成了研究员-博后-博士-助理的良好学术生态和培养机制。</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>个人主页：</span><span><br/></span><span><span>https://www.westlake.edu.cn/faculty/xin-yuan.html</span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请对象</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>智能信息技术—人工智能方向（西湖大学电子科学与技术博士学位）</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请时间</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>2025年4月30日上午10时至6月26日上午10时</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>申请系统网址：</span><span><br/></span><span>https://gradadmission.westlake.edu.cn/</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>1. 中华人民共和国公民；</span><span><br/></span><span>2. 具有浓厚的学术研究兴趣，有志于追求科学研究工作；</span><span><br/></span><span>3. 学习主动性强，理论知识扎实，成绩优秀，专业能力强；</span><span><br/></span><span>4. 身心健康，品德端正，有较强的创新意识、创新能力，富有探索精神；</span><span><br/></span><span>5. 国内高校应届本科毕业生预计能取得所在高校2026年推荐免试资格；国（境）外高校应届本科毕业生最迟须在2026年入学前取得教育部学历学位认证报告。</span><span><br/></span><span>6. 英语水平优秀，原则上须符合以下条件之一：</span><span><br/></span><span>（1）大学英语六级成绩达到460分及以上（其中智能信息技术专业要求480分及以上）；</span><span><br/></span><span>（2）托福（TOEFL）成绩达到90分及以上；</span><span><br/></span><span>（3）雅思（IELTS）成绩达到6.0及以上；</span><span><br/></span><span>（4）攻读国（境）外全英文授课学位项目学习并获得学位。</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>5</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>详细情况</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>详细情况请参考：</span><span><br/></span><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkwODIzNDAwNA==&amp;mid=2247498462&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=c2955cc726f34870cd4bffb66138c76c&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">西湖大学工学院2025年夏令营公告</a></span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>6</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>学校地址：浙江省杭州市西湖区墩余路600号（云谷校区）</span><span><br/></span><span>邮箱：xylab@westlake.edu.cn</span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><strong><span>—END—</span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/M9EQ9m70DkHg7pQBia0y7e2KGjjgPOLkv1YQy32D0x4QSAwHvyaQNuw1z4eWvbUjVvSbP18DKicWUKEUPiaTzTNLQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>西湖大学感知与计算成像实验室</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"e9bd5b8c0a0f778cb4f4d32d131334d3810e0d341c1dc1c282ed79679484546a","textLength":1779,"sourceSha256":"6fe25d03700abaa59fe31e9b756300c3173f07fc97df10652b3f22a74283e4c4","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-04197685c5dd4230745e","title":"2025年西湖大学工学院感知与计算成像实验室2025年夏令营招生","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:53.128318+00:00"}
